- Enabling supported serverless security assessment capabilities.
- Defining production and non-production resource classifications.
- Identifying GovRAMP in-scope serverless functions.
- Configuring resource access permissions.
- Establishing vulnerability severity and reporting requirements.
- Mapping serverless resources to responsible application teams.

